        <mxCell id="k3sKyQmKgb3j_hQE832h-15" parent="1" style="text;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=13;" value="前缀查找    返回：(命中块KVCacheBlocks, 命中token数, shared_prefix_boundary)&#xa;def get_computed_blocks(self, request: Request) -&gt; tuple[KVCacheBlocks, int, int]:&#xa;        max_cache_hit_length = request.num_tokens - 1    # 即使所有token命中，最后一个token也必须重算logits&#xa;        computed_blocks, num_new_computed_tokens, num_uncached = (&#xa;            self.coordinator.find_longest_cache_hit(&#xa;                request.block_hashes, max_cache_hit_length    # 调用Coordinator查找&#xa;            )&#xa;        )    &#xa;" vertex="1">
